olds.\n\nNow I'm structuring the paper with standard sections: abstract, introduction, the violation landscape analysis, the OntoCoDec framework, experiments, related work, and conclusion.\n\nI'm planning out the experimental tables—per-relation violation rates, prompt comparisons, ablations for both datasets, cross-model results, and bootstrap confidence intervals—but consolidating them to fit the 8-page constraint.\n\nWriting the paper now...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":201,"cache_read_input_tokens":44718,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":201},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a51add05-6051-462e-a63a-b66a58770120","uuid":"43188551-a63d-4e74-936d-3d6e31baa174"}
